  "description": "⭐ <em>Get ready for an epic adventure at Babylon Park! </em><strong><em>London’s first-ever underground theme park</em></strong><em> is packed with exciting rides, awesome arcade games, and the city’s only indoor rollercoaster. It’s fun for all ages! Get your tickets today to enjoy </em><strong><em>unlimited access</em></strong><em> to 2 floors of epic rides and arcade games!</em><br>\n<br>\n<strong>Highlights</strong><br>\n🤩 Enjoy unlimited access to 2 floors of epic rides including Tagada, Drop Tower, Bumper Cars, and more.&nbsp;<br>\n🎢 Zoom through the galaxy on the city’s only indoor rollercoaster.<br>\n🎮 Test your skills on tonnes of arcade games as many times as you can.<br>\n👶 Explore the 2 soft play zones —perfect for little explorers (individual tickets sold).<br>\n👽 Step into an alien-themed wonderland and be transported to outer space.<br>\n🥳 Ideal for birthday parties, team-building days, and other special occasions. Click <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://babylonpark.com/groups/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">here</a> for more information on group bookings<br>\n🎁 Gift memories to someone special! Purchase a gift card for Babylon Park: London’s Underground Theme Park <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://feverup.com/m/364288\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">here</a><br>\n<br>\n<strong>General Info</strong><br>\n🎟️Please note entry to the park is free. You can purchase tickets for unlimited access to all attractions and games!&nbsp;<br>\n📅 Dates and times: select your date &amp; time directly in the ticket selector<br>\n🕒 Opening hours:<br>\n- Monday–Friday: 10:00 a.m. – 9:00 p.m.<br>\n- Saturday: 10:00 a.m. – 10:00 p.m.<br>\n- Sunday: 10:00 a.m. – 9:00 p.m.<br>\n⏳ Duration: Varies based on ticket purchased. Access begins when you receive your wristband on entry.<br>\n📍 Location: Babylon Park, Camden, London<br>\n👤 Age requirement: Babylon Park is perfect for adults and children of all ages. There is no minimum age requirement for the indoor theme park. The drop tower and rollercoaster have a height restriction.<br>\n♿ Accessibility: The venue is wheelchair accessible, however, the rides are not.<br>\n❓ Please consult the FAQs of this experience <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://babylonpark.com/london/#faqs\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">here</a><br>\n<br>\n<strong>Description</strong><br>\nWelcome to <em>Babylon Park</em>, London’s best-kept secret. As the city’s first-ever underground theme park, Babylon Park promises an epic day out—whatever the weather! Whether you’re zooming through space on London’s only indoor rollercoaster, testing your skills on epic arcade games, or getting creative in the play-and-colour zone, Babylon Park promises a fun-filled adventure for all ages. The best part? Your admission ticket offers you unlimited access to all attractions, so you can enjoy your favourites as many times as you like during your chosen time! Don’t miss out—get your tickets today!",
